        "description": "Resolve an immutable published release or registered working target through Projects. Current access is checked before replay; exact recorded replays do not resolve a newer revision. New admission follows schema/default/file/profile preparation and activation of every input and source pin. Bundle execution is rejected before admission. Cache policy records intent; reuse belongs to E15.",
